{
  "uid": "km-load",
  "title": "KashmirMenu \u2014 Load Testing (k6)",
  "description": "Populated only while a k6 run exports to Prometheus remote write. Empty at all other times, which is expected.",
  "tags": [
    "kashmirmenu",
    "load-testing",
    "k6"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "When this dashboard has data",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These panels read metrics written by **k6**, not by the application, and only appear while a test is running with remote write enabled:\n\n```\nk6 run --out experimental-prometheus-rw k6/baseline.js\n```\n\nBetween runs the panels are empty. That is correct, not a broken dashboard - no placeholder series are generated to fill the space.\n\nk6's Prometheus remote-write output is an **experimental** k6 feature. See `PERFORMANCE_TESTING_GUIDE.md` for the setup and for why the thresholds are provisional."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Virtual users",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "k6_vus",
          "legendFormat": "VUs",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "k6_vus_max",
          "legendFormat": "max VUs",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests / sec",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "rps",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request duration percentiles",
      "description": "k6 computes these itself and exports them as gauges, which is why they are read directly rather than through histogram_quantile.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p99",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_avg",
          "legendFormat": "avg",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed request rate",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_req_failed_total[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "failure ratio",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Application latency during the test",
      "description": "The server's own view, next to k6's client-side view above. A gap between them is network or client overhead rather than application slowness.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"kashmirmenu\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "server p95",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Application resources during the test",
      "description": "What the load cost the application. The point of a load test is this panel, not the throughput number.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage{job=\"kashmirmenu\"}",
          "legendFormat": "cpu",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "kashmirmenu-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=\"kashmirmenu\",area=\"heap\"}) / clamp_min(sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{job=\"kashmirmenu\",area=\"heap\"}), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "heap utilisation",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  }
}
